  00ec:  jump section_6+0x354
  00f0:  speak 6 "He doesn't feel well,\ndoes he? You have to take\ncare of his health!\n"
  017e:  showTextbox "Let me treat him right away.\nFee will be discounted\nto three hundred bits.\n"
